          {
            "name": "mode_4",
            "type": "CRD"
          },
          {
            "name": "continuous",
            "type": "BOOL"
          }
        ]
      },
      "notes": "Averaging is deliberately NOT in this query. ':TRACe:AVERage:COUNt?' does not answer on firmware A.02.07 — probed 2026-08-07 — and one dead statement kills the whole chained reply, taking the four trace modes with it. Verified as written: 'WRIT;BLAN;BLAN;BLAN;1', no error."
    },
